From 47631dc443a8d6d8ae40ffa73413061e0ad7cadc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayachandran C <jayachandranc@google.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 02:20:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [RESTRICT AUTOMERGE] [Telephony] Fix RCS config credential
 leak via ISub

Removed SimInfo.COLUMN_RCS_CONFIG from the whitelist of directly
accessible subscription columns. This prevents sensitive RCS
provisioning XML (including credentials) from being exposed via the
ISub.getSubscriptionProperty and ISub.setSubscriptionProperty AIDL
methods, which are only protected by the READ_PHONE_STATE permission.

Bug: 515391495
Bug: 517377710
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Test: atest SubscriptionManagerServiceTest
Change-Id: I3584ca300bded5adc8c9930422f13ab6207fcf70
(cherry picked from commit 8290e21f121659600f7d1ebb5d4023a5a20fe4db)

TAG=agy
CONV=c52f4aa7-95e5-45b1-b8c3-4e6dc926dfdd

Change-Id: I89e1fbcbc41dbe8bca7fb0b304ca9a2a9bdc1fde
